  "description": "Operating Area: Croatia\n\nMS Adriatic Blue is an elegant deluxe vessel designed for relaxed cruising along the stunning Adriatic coast. This charming ship offers an intimate onboard atmosphere, allowing guests to experience Croatia’s islands, historic towns, and crystal-clear bays in comfort and style. With its spacious decks, modern amenities, and carefully designed cabins, Adriatic Blue creates the perfect balance between leisure and exploration. Guests can spend their days swimming in secluded coves and their evenings discovering the vibrant coastal destinations of Dalmatia.\n",
